    <div class="item"><div class="ic">🌙</div><h4>Boho-Design</h4><p>Kristall, Naturstein &amp; Symbole</p></div>
    <div class="item"><div class="ic">🚚</div><h4>Lieferzeit 5–7 Tage</h4><p>Sicher &amp; verfolgbar verpackt</p></div>
  </div>
</div>
